{
  "about": "File entry, preparation and application contracts a study directory states (FILE-7, INPUT-1, LAYER-2, SCHEMA-2, SCHEMA-12, CHECK-9): a project file and an input that a run cannot read are refused before any study read, a static check needs no study data and a build without it cannot save, an entry's version and its parent's findings keep their layer context, a dictionary fails at its authored field, and a pattern or a data-driven LIKE is an ordinary value test. Moved from file_diagnostic_origins.rs; its file_preparation cases ran FileSpecification::prepare and now run the public check, whose rows are the same. Every value is its test's but the build without study data, whose test asserted only that it reported issues: its row is the missing input of temporal.json's cases (FILE-7), found among the issues.",
